cs)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/craft-docs)` |\n| [**Metatool App MCP**](https://github.com/metatool-ai/metatool-app) | @metatool-ai | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/metatool-app) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/metatool-app)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/metatool-app)` |\n| [**Alderpost MCP**](https://github.com/8randonpickart5/alderpost-mcp) | @8randonpickart5 | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/alderpost-mcp) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/alderpost-mcp)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/alderpost-mcp)` |\n| [**Open Task Relay Public MCP**](https://github.com/lanekingsbery/open-task-relay-public) | @lanekingsbery | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/open-task-relay-public) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/open-task-relay-public)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/open-task-relay-public)` |\n| [**Agy Bridge MCP**](https://github.com/sshahzaiib/agy-bridge) | @sshahzaiib | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/agy-bridge) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/agy-bridge)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/agy-bridge)` |\n| [**Imagen3 MCP**](https://github.com/hamflx/imagen3-mcp) | @hamflx | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/imagen3-mcp) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/imagen3-mcp)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/imagen3-mcp)` |\n| [**Firefox Devtools MCP**](https://github.com/freema/firefox-devtools-mcp) | @freema | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/firefox-devtools-mcp) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/firefox-devtools-mcp)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/firefox-devtools-mcp)` |\n| [**Personalizationmcp**](https://github.com/YangLiangwei/PersonalizationMCP) | @YangLiangwei | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/personalizationmcp) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/personalizationmcp)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/personalizationmcp)` |\n| [**Outsource MCP**](https://github.com/gwbischof/outsource-mcp) | @gwbischof | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/outsource-mcp) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/outsource-mcp)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/outsource-mcp)` |\n| [**Releases MCP**](https://github.com/Proofpane/releases) | @Proofpane | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/releases) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/releases)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/releases)` |\n| [**Hetzner Dns MCP**](https://github.com/ni-c/hetzner-dns-mcp) | @ni-c | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/hetzner-dns-mcp) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/hetzner-dns-mcp)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/hetzner-dns-mcp)` |\n| [**Ratatosk MCP**](https://github.com/garlicKim21/ratatosk-mcp) | @garlicKim21 | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/ratatosk-mcp) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/ratatosk-mcp)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/ratatosk-mcp)` |\n| [**Lambdacad MCP**](https://github.com/Psalmustrack/lambdacad-mcp) | @Psalmustrack | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/lambdacad-mcp) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/lambdacad-mcp)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/lambdacad-mcp)` |\n| [**Mcp**](https://github.com/noteboxd/mcp) | @noteboxd | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/mcp-3) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/mcp-3)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/mcp-3)` |","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonylate520/mcp-serverlist/issues/4/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonylate520/mcp-serverlist/issues/4/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lets-order-some-fries/trovark/issues/22","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lets-order-some-fries/trovark","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lets-order-some-fries/trovark/issues/22/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lets-order-some-fries/trovark/issues/22/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lets-order-some-fries/trovark/issues/22/events","html_url":"https://github.com/lets-order-some-fries/trovark/issues/22","id":5388341655,"node_id":"I_kwDOTphPns8AAAABQSuRlw","number":22,"title":"Tool-surface under-read is invisible on repos that do not use a tools/ directory: 4 of 125 tools published as a complete count","user":{"login":"lets-order-some-fries","id":34904987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTA0OTg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34904987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lets-order-some-fries","html_url":"https://github.com/lets-order-some-fries","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lets-order-some-fries/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lets-order-some-fries/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lets-order-some-fries/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lets-order-some-fries/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lets-order-some-fries/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lets-order-some-fries/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lets-order-some-fries/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lets-order-some-fries/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lets-order-some-fries/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-08T14:58:49Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:01:48Z","closed_at":"2026-09-25T17:01:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## What happens\n\n`github/github-mcp-server` — the repo used as the headline example in README.md:7 and as the\nsample `--json` scorecard at README.md:131-134 — is published with **`toolCount: 4`**.\n\nThe repo actually defines **125 distinct tool names**, 34 of them write or delete verbs\n(`delete_file`, `push_files`, `merge_pull_request`, `create_or_update_file`,\n`create_repository`, `fork_repository`, …).\n\nThe four that were read are `ui_get`, `get_me`, `get_teams`, `get_team_members` — all\nread-only, all from a 13-file sample. Everything downstream then treats that sample as the\nwhole surface:\n\n| field | published | reality |\n|---|---|---|\n| `toolCount` | 4 | 125 |\n| `toolSurfaceRisk` | `low` | 34 destructive verbs |\n| cost | 100/100 (the ≤10-tools band) | not measurable from 4 of 125 |\n| security | 85/100 (primary, weight 3 of 6) | built on the wrong risk |\n| overall | **96/100 A+** | — |\n| `errors` | `[]` | — |\n| partial-read note | none | — |\n\nThere is no signal anywhere on the card that the read was partial.\n\n## Why the existing guard misses it\n\n`isToolFanoutPath` (src/collectors/github.ts:293) only matches `(^|/)tools?/` or `.tools.ts`.\nThis repo keeps its 56 non-test tool files in `pkg/github/*.go`, so `toolFanoutCount` is `0`,\n`detectSurfacePartial` (src/derive/schema.ts:1411) evaluates `0 > 0` as false, `surfacePartial`\nstays false, and src/assemble.ts:226-228 publishes the sample count as complete.\n\nThe guard itself works — `grafana/mcp-grafana` keeps its tools under `tools/`, the guard fires,\nand cost is correctly withheld. The detector is coupled to one directory convention rather than\nto the thing it is trying to measure.\n\n## Suggested direction\n\nMake the partiality check independent of directory naming: after extraction, for each directory\nthat produced an extracted tool (`schema.tools[].evidence` already carries the source path),\ncompare how many source files that directory holds in the tree against how many were fetched.\nSampled < detected means `surfacePartial`.\n\n## Why this is filed rather than fixed\n\n**It moves published grades.** Servers currently graded would flip to withheld cost/security,\nand some to INSUFFICIENT DATA through the `securityPrimaryAbsent` gate in score.ts — including\nthe A+ 96 in the README. It is not a rubric change (no weights, bands or `RUBRIC_VERSION`\ntouched), but the blast radius should be measured against `index/results.json` before landing,\nand the README example probably needs choosing again afterwards.\n\nThat is a call for the maintainer, not something to slip in.\n\n## Reproduction\n\n```\nnode dist/assemble.js github/github-mcp-server\n# => {\"toolCount\":4,\"toolNames\":[\"ui_get\",\"get_me\",\"get_teams\",\"get_team_members\"],\n#     \"toolSurfaceRisk\":\"low\",\"schemaExtracted\":true,\"errors\":[]}\n```\n\nGround truth: grep for `Name: \"...\"` inside `mcp.Tool{}` literals under `pkg/github/*.go`.\n\nContrast: `grafana/mcp-grafana` in the same run returns `toolCount: undefined` with cost withheld.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lets-order-some-fries/trovark/issues/22/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lets-order-some-fries/trovark/issues/22/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/issues/28","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/issues/28/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/issues/28/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/issues/28/events","html_url":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28","id":4045880613,"node_id":"PR_kwDONvrgrc7JFo5u","number":28,"title":"Next.js 16 / React 19 メジャーアップグレードとコードベース監査・堅牢化計画 (Plan 001〜006) の策定","user":{"login":"myoshi2891","id":96483039,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcA23w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96483039?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myoshi2891","html_url":"https://github.com/myoshi2891","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myoshi2891/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myoshi2891/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myoshi2891/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myoshi2891/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myoshi2891/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myoshi2891/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myoshi2891/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myoshi2891/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myoshi2891/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":52,"created_at":"2026-03-09T14:18:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T11:09:25Z","closed_at":"2026-09-18T11:09:24Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pulls/28","html_url":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28","diff_url":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/myoshi2891/Next-Store/pull/28.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-18T11:09:24Z"},"body":"大きく分けて以下の5つの柱で対応が進められました：\r\n\r\n1. **Next.js 16 / React 19 / Clerk v7 へのメジャー移行（TDDアプローチ）**\r\n2. **セキュリティ脆弱性（Image Optimizer DoS, AVIF RCE, SSRF等）へのパッチ対応**\r\n3. **型安全性・Lint・CIスクリプト等の開発基盤刷新**\r\n4. **AIエージェント向け監査・改善スキル（`improve` / `closing-the-loop`）の構築**\r\n5. **プロダクト堅牢化に向けた6つの詳細実装計画書（`plans/001〜006`）の策定・精緻化**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## **主な対応内容**\r\n\r\n### **1. フレームワークのメジャーアップグレード & 互換性修正 (TDD)**\r\n\r\nテストを先行作成（RED）した上で、破壊的変更への移行を完了：\r\n\r\n- **React 19 移行**: 非推奨となった `useFormState` を  へ刷新。\r\n    \r\n    **`useActionState`**\r\n    \r\n- **Next.js 16 移行**: `params` / `searchParams` の非同期化（`Promise`）に対応し、関連ページやテストを改修。\r\n- **Clerk v7 移行**: `auth()` の呼び出しを `async/await` に移行。\r\n- **型安全性向上**: Server Actions の `prevState` を `any` から `{ message: string }` に型制約を厳格化。\r\n\r\n### **2. セキュリティ脆弱性対策とパッチ適用**\r\n\r\n- **Next.js の段階的バージョンアップ**: 16.2.11 → 16.3.3 へ更新し、既知の脆弱性（GHSA-9g9p-9gw9-jx7f, AVIF RCE: GHSA-2xp9-vwfh-vxw4）に対処。\r\n- **画像オプティマイザ防御**:  の `remotePatterns` に `pathname` 制限を追加し、Image Optimizer DoS（GHSA-q8wf-6r8g-63ch）および Clerk ホストのパスマッチを厳格化。\r\n    \r\n    **next.config.mjs**\r\n    \r\n- **SSRF & 入力検証**: チェックアウト時の入力バリデーションおよび SSRF 対策のための環境制限を導入。\r\n- **認可ロジック抽出**: `middleware.ts` から `isAdminUser` を独立した実関数として切り出し、単体テストを追加。\r\n\r\n### **3. ツールチェーン & 品質保証の改善**\r\n\r\n- **ESLint 9 Flat Config への移行**:  から  へ刷新。\r\n    \r\n    **.eslintrc.json**\r\n    \r\n    **eslint.config.mjs**\r\n    \r\n- **型検査コマンド新設**: `package.json` に `typecheck` スクリプトを追加し、`test` 実行時に型チェックを統合。\r\n- **リグレッション検証**: Checkout ページの `Suspense` boundary 内包確認、`searchParams` の配列入力対応やパラメータ正規化のテストを拡充。\r\n\r\n### **4. 改善スキル（`improve` / `closing-the-loop`）の設計・強化**\r\n\r\n**.agents/skills/improve/** 配下に、コードベース監査とタスク実行を自律化・安全化するための規約を定義：\r\n\r\n- **監査プレイブック & テンプレート**: `audit-playbook.md`, `plan-template.md` の標準化。\r\n- **安全規約・ドリフト検証**: 実行時のベースコミット (`execution base SHA`) に基づくスコープ検証、プロンプトインジェクション対策、STALE 状態ハンドリング、GitHub Issue 重複作成抑止ルールを整備。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/issues/28/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/myoshi2891/Next-Store/issues/28/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperpolymath/rsr-template-repo/issues/83","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperpolymath/rsr-template-repo","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperpolymath/rsr-template-repo/issues/83/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperpolymath/rsr-template-repo/issues/83/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperpolymath/rsr-template-repo/issues/83/events","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperpolymath/rsr-template-repo/pull/83","id":5412290100,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTeRBCM8AAAABC_fpiA","number":83,"title":"Exempt reviewed Hypatia research-extension findings","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":16,"created_at":"2026-09-10T12:40:41Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T17:05:22Z","closed_at":"2026-09-17T17:05:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperpolymath/rsr-template-repo/pulls/83","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperpolymath/rsr-template-repo/pull/83","diff_url":"https://github.com/hyperpolymath/rsr-template-repo/pull/83.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/hyperpolymath/rsr-template-repo/pull/83.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-17T17:05:21Z"},"body":"Add narrowly scoped Hypatia ignore entries for reviewed RE001, RE005, and RE008 findings across affected workflows, documenting why each advisory does not apply while preserving checks for new workflows. This aligns with the task intent by preventing the known Hypatia scan failures. Validation was not run.\n\n[View coding task](https://app.coderabbit.ai/code/tasks/f36ac704-d4fb-467c-8b3e-1c03b4b82f62?source=coding_agent_github_pr_description)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperpolymath/rsr-template-repo/issues/83/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperpolymath/rsr-template-repo/issues/83/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/issues/217","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/issues/217/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/issues/217/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/issues/217/events","html_url":"https://github.com/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/pull/217","id":4557932663,"node_id":"PR_kwDOKDzNHs7hGxLA","number":217,"title":"Add AIMarket Agent and AIMarket SDKs (protocol v2)","user":{"login":"alexart2025","id":203622159,"node_id":"U_kgDODCMHDw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203622159?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025","html_url":"https://github.com/alexart2025","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10897423376,"node_id":"LA_kwDOKDzNHs8AAAACiYl8EA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/labels/cla-signed","name":"cla-signed","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-05-31T14:54:11Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T19:37:46Z","closed_at":"2026-07-29T19:37:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/pulls/217","html_url":"https://github.com/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/pull/217","diff_url":"https://github.com/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/pull/217.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/pull/217.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Summary\nAdds two related SDKs for [AIMarket Protocol v2](https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-protocol) — federated discovery, HTTP 402 payment channels, safety-gated invoke, and settlement with signed receipts.\n\n| Project | Role |\n|---------|------|\n| [aimarket-agent](https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-agent) | Python SDK + CLI (`pip install aimarket-agent`) |\n| [aimarket-sdks](https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-sdks) | Dart (alpha), TypeScript/Rust clients |\n\nReference hub: https://modelmarket.dev\n\n## Why this list\nThese are client libraries for building autonomous agents that discover and pay for capabilities across a federation — aligned with “SDKs for creating and deploying AI agents.”\n\nNot affiliated with e2b; independent open-source (MIT).","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/issues/217/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/issues/217/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/issues/8422","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/issues/8422/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/issues/8422/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/issues/8422/events","html_url":"https://github.com/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/pull/8422","id":4708230139,"node_id":"PR_kwDONWz9ps7owMul","number":8422,"title":"Add aimarket-oracle-gateway (verifiable oracle MCP server)","user":{"login":"alexart2025","id":203622159,"node_id":"U_kgDODCMHDw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203622159?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025","html_url":"https://github.com/alexart2025","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10350553194,"node_id":"LA_kwDONWz9ps8AAAACaPDoag","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/labels/has-emoji","name":"has-emoji","color":"40d01d","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":10350553200,"node_id":"LA_kwDONWz9ps8AAAACaPDocA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/labels/valid-name","name":"valid-name","color":"40d01d","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":10350561209,"node_id":"LA_kwDONWz9ps8AAAACaPEHuQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/labels/has-glama","name":"has-glama","color":"40d01d","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-20T20:12:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-11T14:27:28Z","closed_at":"2026-07-11T14:27:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/pulls/8422","html_url":"https://github.com/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/pull/8422","diff_url":"https://github.com/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/pull/8422.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/pull/8422.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Summary\n\nAdds **alexar76/aimarket-oracle-gateway** to the **Security** section — a separate MCP server from our existing **Aggregators** entry (`aimarket-plugins` / mcp-packager).\n\nMIT · Python · stdio MCP server exposing verifiable oracle tools for AI agents:\n- **Platon VRF** — Ed25519-signed unbiasable randomness (`get_random`, `get_randomness_beacon`, `ask_oracle`)\n- **Chronos VDF** — verifiable delay / proof-of-elapsed-time (`compute_vdf`, `verify_vdf`)\n- **LUMEN reputation** — PageRank/EigenTrust trust scores (`get_reputation_scores`)\n- `list_oracle_capabilities`\n\nPay-per-call over the [AIMarket Protocol v2](https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-protocol); every result is independently verifiable. Fail-closed spend caps.\n\n- Repo: https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-oracle-gateway\n- Glama: https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/alexar76/aimarket-oracle-gateway\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] Alphabetical placement in Security (after `alexfleetcommander`, before `alberthild`)\n- [x] Distinct from existing `alexar76/aimarket-plugins` Aggregators entry (different repo, different purpose)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/issues/8422/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/punkpeye/awesome-mcp-servers/issues/8422/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}